<title>USA: Westminster, Colo., $23 mln yields 5.50 pct.</title>
<headline>Westminster, Colo., $23 mln yields 5.50 pct.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hanifen, Imhoff Inc said it repriced $23.370 Westminster, Colo., special purpose sales tax revenue (Post Project) bonds, Series 1997B with a top yield of 5.50 percent in 2016.</p>
</text>
